NAME: Weather

DESCRIPTION:

Weather forecast is obtained from 
https://api.weather.gov.

Text-to-speech system reads the
detailed weather report aloud.

If the weather forecast has been 
downloaded within the past 4 hours the 
forecast is not downloaded again. Select
'R' to force a new forecast download.

Display choices:
- Day:  daytime
- D+N:  day and night
- Hour: hourly

Selecting a Day or D+N forecast will 
display and speak the detailed forecast.

NOTES:

Downloading the forecast can take 
several seconds.
